{"id":"4db9fd38055efd65","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-second-order.md","title":"二阶逻辑 SO","display":"df-second-order — 二阶逻辑 SO","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-second-order","aliases":["29-df-second-order"],"display":"df-second-order — 二阶逻辑 SO","depends_on":["[[29-df-free-variable]]","[[29-df-formula]]","[[29-df-term]]","[[29-df-variable]]","[[29-df-vocab]]","[[29-df-atomic-formula]]"],"source_locator":"Definition 7.1, p.113, DjVu scan 128","source_basis":"用户提供的 DjVu 隐藏文本层；核对范围见 Remark","revision_basis":"本次仅据用户提供的29(1).zip修订；既有原书定位及过往核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件","revision_verification":"数学类型与接口审查、静态结构及链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-second-order"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-second-order</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-second-order — 二阶逻辑 SO"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"db2b32546860e623\" href=\"?note=db2b32546860e623\" title=\"29-df-free-variable\">29-df-free-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a3fa1d78e657e6a2\" href=\"?note=a3fa1d78e657e6a2\" title=\"29-df-formula\">29-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"575d9a1532e3c73b\" href=\"?note=575d9a1532e3c73b\" title=\"29-df-term\">29-df-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ad08b66c5e54a436\" href=\"?note=ad08b66c5e54a436\" title=\"29-df-variable\">29-df-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"28e86a5f0243a0ae\" href=\"?note=28e86a5f0243a0ae\" title=\"29-df-vocab\">29-df-vocab</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"19d380b6c383f76b\" href=\"?note=19d380b6c383f76b\" title=\"29-df-atomic-formula\">29-df-atomic-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Definition 7.1, p.113, DjVu scan 128"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户提供的 DjVu 隐藏文本层；核对范围见 Remark"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"本次仅据用户提供的29(1).zip修订；既有原书定位及过往核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件"},{"key":"revision_verification","html":"数学类型与接口审查、静态结构及链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 为有限词汇；对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\geq1\">\\(k\\geq1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RelVar}_k=\\{X_i^k:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{RelVar}_k=\\{X_i^k:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span> 为互异的新关系变量集，与词汇符号及个体变量不交。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau,\\mathrm{Term}_\\tau,\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau,\\mathrm{Term}_\\tau,\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span> 见所列依赖。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf v(t)\">\\(\\mathsf v(t)\\)</span> 为项树中作为叶出现的个体变量集合；原子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 中的项按全部直接参数项遍历。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Vocabulary}\">\\(\\mathrm{Vocabulary}\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"28e86a5f0243a0ae\" href=\"?note=28e86a5f0243a0ae\" title=\"29-df-vocab\">29-df-vocab</a> 的有限词汇类；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SO}\">\\(\\mathrm{SO}\\)</span> 在下式中标记扩张语法。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\">\\(\\forall,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\)</span> 在本条作为实际语法构造子处理；以下规则替代任何“先按标准缩写展开”的先决约定。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>关系变量使用带元数标签的构造子：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_i^k=X_j^\\ell\\Longleftrightarrow(i=j\\land k=\\ell)\">\\(X_i^k=X_j^\\ell\\Longleftrightarrow(i=j\\land k=\\ell)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\\subseteq\\mathrm{RelVar}\">\\(V\\subseteq\\mathrm{RelVar}\\)</span> 为有限集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{AtMat}[\\tau;V]\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{AtMat}[\\tau;V]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{SO}}[\\tau]\">\\(\\phi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{SO}}[\\tau]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}\">\\(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\in\\{\\exists,\\forall\\}\">\\(Q\\in\\{\\exists,\\forall\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar z\">\\(\\bar z\\)</span> 为个体变量序列或关系变量序列，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar Q\">\\(\\bar Q\\)</span> 为同长量词序列，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\rangle\">\\(\\langle\\rangle\\)</span> 为空序列，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Vert\">\\(\\Vert\\)</span> 为序列串接。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Pref}(\\bar Q,\\bar z,\\phi)\">\\(\\operatorname{Pref}(\\bar Q,\\bar z,\\phi)\\)</span> 的各量词对其后缀起作用；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Qz\">\\(Qz\\)</span> 仅在变量类型与所用公式语法相容时使用。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigwedge\\bar\\phi\">\\(\\bigwedge\\bar\\phi\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigvee\\bar\\phi\">\\(\\bigvee\\bar\\phi\\)</span> 以下式确定括号和空序列值。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{qr}_1\">\\(\\mathrm{qr}_1\\)</span> 的定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigcup_{V\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathrm{RelVar}}\\operatorname{Mat}_{\\mathrm{SO}}[\\tau;V]\">\\(\\bigcup_{V\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathrm{RelVar}}\\operatorname{Mat}_{\\mathrm{SO}}[\\tau;V]\\)</span>；其递归仅取该域内的语法构造。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fv}_1,\\operatorname{fv}_2\">\\(\\operatorname{fv}_1,\\operatorname{fv}_2\\)</span> 的定义域仍为全部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{SO}}[\\tau]\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{SO}}[\\tau]\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle Q\\rangle_{i=1}^{d}\">\\(\\langle Q\\rangle_{i=1}^{d}\\)</span> 表示长度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span>、每个分量均为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 的序列。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RelVar}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\geq1}\\mathrm{RelVar}_{k}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{RelVar}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\geq1}\\mathrm{RelVar}_{k}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}second\\text{-}order}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{SO}}[\\tau]\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\left\\{\n\\mathcal F\\ \\middle|\\\n\\begin{array}{l}\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\tau}\\cup\n\\displaystyle\\bigcup_{k\\geq1}\n\\{X(\\bar t)\\mid X\\in\\mathrm{RelVar}_{k},\\ \\bar t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{\\tau}^{k}\\}\n\\subseteq\\mathcal F,\\\\\n\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\;\n\\forall\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}\\;\\forall Q\\in\\{\\exists,\\forall\\}\\;(\\neg\\varphi,\\varphi\\circ\\psi,Qx\\,\\varphi)\\in\\mathcal F^3,\\\\\n\\forall k\\geq1\\;\\forall X\\in\\mathrm{RelVar}_{k}\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathcal F\\;\n(\\exists X\\,\\varphi,\\forall X\\,\\varphi)\\in\\mathcal F^2\n\\end{array}\n\\right\\},\n\\qquad\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}second\\text{-}order}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{SO}}[\\tau]\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\left\\{\n\\mathcal F\\ \\middle|\\\n\\begin{array}{l}\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\tau}\\cup\n\\displaystyle\\bigcup_{k\\geq1}\n\\{X(\\bar t)\\mid X\\in\\mathrm{RelVar}_{k},\\ \\bar t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{\\tau}^{k}\\}\n\\subseteq\\mathcal F,\\\\\n\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\;\n\\forall\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}\\;\\forall Q\\in\\{\\exists,\\forall\\}\\;(\\neg\\varphi,\\varphi\\circ\\psi,Qx\\,\\varphi)\\in\\mathcal F^3,\\\\\n\\forall k\\geq1\\;\\forall X\\in\\mathrm{RelVar}_{k}\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathcal F\\;\n(\\exists X\\,\\varphi,\\forall X\\,\\varphi)\\in\\mathcal F^2\n\\end{array}\n\\right\\},\n\\qquad\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fv}_1(t=u)\\coloneqq\\mathsf v(t)\\cup\\mathsf v(u),\\qquad\\operatorname{fv}_2(t=u)\\coloneqq\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{fv}_1(t=u)\\coloneqq\\mathsf v(t)\\cup\\mathsf v(u),\\qquad\\operatorname{fv}_2(t=u)\\coloneqq\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fv}_1(P(\\bar t))\\coloneqq\\bigcup_i\\mathsf v(t_i),\\qquad\\operatorname{fv}_2(P(\\bar t))\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\{P\\},&amp;P\\in\\mathrm{RelVar},\\\\\\varnothing,&amp;P\\in\\tau.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{fv}_1(P(\\bar t))\\coloneqq\\bigcup_i\\mathsf v(t_i),\\qquad\\operatorname{fv}_2(P(\\bar t))\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\{P\\},&amp;P\\in\\mathrm{RelVar},\\\\\\varnothing,&amp;P\\in\\tau.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fv}_a(\\neg\\phi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fv}_a(\\phi),\\qquad\\operatorname{fv}_a(\\phi\\land\\psi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fv}_a(\\phi)\\cup\\operatorname{fv}_a(\\psi),\\qquad a\\in\\{1,2\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{fv}_a(\\neg\\phi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fv}_a(\\phi),\\qquad\\operatorname{fv}_a(\\phi\\land\\psi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fv}_a(\\phi)\\cup\\operatorname{fv}_a(\\psi),\\qquad a\\in\\{1,2\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fv}_1(\\exists x\\,\\phi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fv}_1(\\phi)\\setminus\\{x\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{fv}_2(\\exists x\\,\\phi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fv}_2(\\phi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{fv}_1(\\exists x\\,\\phi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fv}_1(\\phi)\\setminus\\{x\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{fv}_2(\\exists x\\,\\phi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fv}_2(\\phi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fv}_1(\\exists R\\,\\phi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fv}_1(\\phi),\\qquad\\operatorname{fv}_2(\\exists R\\,\\phi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fv}_2(\\phi)\\setminus\\{R\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{fv}_1(\\exists R\\,\\phi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fv}_1(\\phi),\\qquad\\operatorname{fv}_2(\\exists R\\,\\phi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fv}_2(\\phi)\\setminus\\{R\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{SO}}[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{SO}}[\\tau]\\mid\\operatorname{fv}_1(\\phi)=\\operatorname{fv}_2(\\phi)=\\varnothing\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{SO}[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{SO}}[\\tau].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{SO}}[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{SO}}[\\tau]\\mid\\operatorname{fv}_1(\\phi)=\\operatorname{fv}_2(\\phi)=\\varnothing\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{SO}[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{SO}}[\\tau].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fv}_a(\\top)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fv}_a(\\bot)\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\qquad a\\in\\{1,2\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{fv}_a(\\top)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fv}_a(\\bot)\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\qquad a\\in\\{1,2\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fv}_a(\\phi\\circ\\psi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fv}_a(\\phi)\\cup\\operatorname{fv}_a(\\psi),\\qquad a\\in\\{1,2\\},\\quad\\circ\\in\\{\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{fv}_a(\\phi\\circ\\psi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fv}_a(\\phi)\\cup\\operatorname{fv}_a(\\psi),\\qquad a\\in\\{1,2\\},\\quad\\circ\\in\\{\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fv}_1(\\forall x\\,\\phi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fv}_1(\\phi)\\setminus\\{x\\},\\quad\\operatorname{fv}_2(\\forall x\\,\\phi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fv}_2(\\phi),\\quad\\operatorname{fv}_1(\\forall R\\,\\phi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fv}_1(\\phi),\\quad\\operatorname{fv}_2(\\forall R\\,\\phi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fv}_2(\\phi)\\setminus\\{R\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{fv}_1(\\forall x\\,\\phi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fv}_1(\\phi)\\setminus\\{x\\},\\quad\\operatorname{fv}_2(\\forall x\\,\\phi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fv}_2(\\phi),\\quad\\operatorname{fv}_1(\\forall R\\,\\phi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fv}_1(\\phi),\\quad\\operatorname{fv}_2(\\forall R\\,\\phi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fv}_2(\\phi)\\setminus\\{R\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rar}:\\mathrm{RelVar}\\to\\mathbb N_{\\geq1},\\qquad\\operatorname{rar}(X_i^k)\\coloneqq k.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{rar}:\\mathrm{RelVar}\\to\\mathbb N_{\\geq1},\\qquad\\operatorname{rar}(X_i^k)\\coloneqq k.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AtMat}[\\tau;V]\\coloneqq\\mathrm{AtFml}_\\tau\\cup\\{R(\\bar t)\\mid R\\in V,\\ \\bar t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_\\tau^{\\operatorname{rar}(R)}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{AtMat}[\\tau;V]\\coloneqq\\mathrm{AtFml}_\\tau\\cup\\{R(\\bar t)\\mid R\\in V,\\ \\bar t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_\\tau^{\\operatorname{rar}(R)}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Mat}_{\\mathrm{SO}}[\\tau;V]\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\left\\{\\mathcal M\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{SO}}[\\tau]\\ \\middle|\\ \\operatorname{AtMat}[\\tau;V]\\subseteq\\mathcal M\\land\\forall\\phi,\\psi\\in\\mathcal M\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\;\\forall Q\\in\\{\\exists,\\forall\\}\\;\\forall\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}\\;(\\neg\\phi,\\phi\\circ\\psi,Qx\\,\\phi)\\in\\mathcal M^3\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Mat}_{\\mathrm{SO}}[\\tau;V]\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\left\\{\\mathcal M\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{SO}}[\\tau]\\ \\middle|\\ \\operatorname{AtMat}[\\tau;V]\\subseteq\\mathcal M\\land\\forall\\phi,\\psi\\in\\mathcal M\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\;\\forall Q\\in\\{\\exists,\\forall\\}\\;\\forall\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}\\;(\\neg\\phi,\\phi\\circ\\psi,Qx\\,\\phi)\\in\\mathcal M^3\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{qr}_1(\\alpha)\\coloneqq0,\\quad\\mathrm{qr}_1(\\neg\\phi)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{qr}_1(\\phi),\\quad\\mathrm{qr}_1(\\phi\\circ\\psi)\\coloneqq\\max\\{\\mathrm{qr}_1(\\phi),\\mathrm{qr}_1(\\psi)\\},\\quad\\mathrm{qr}_1(Qx\\,\\phi)\\coloneqq1+\\mathrm{qr}_1(\\phi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{qr}_1(\\alpha)\\coloneqq0,\\quad\\mathrm{qr}_1(\\neg\\phi)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{qr}_1(\\phi),\\quad\\mathrm{qr}_1(\\phi\\circ\\psi)\\coloneqq\\max\\{\\mathrm{qr}_1(\\phi),\\mathrm{qr}_1(\\psi)\\},\\quad\\mathrm{qr}_1(Qx\\,\\phi)\\coloneqq1+\\mathrm{qr}_1(\\phi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Pref}(\\langle\\rangle,\\langle\\rangle,\\phi)\\coloneqq\\phi,\\qquad\\operatorname{Pref}(\\langle Q\\rangle\\Vert\\bar Q,\\langle z\\rangle\\Vert\\bar z,\\phi)\\coloneqq Qz\\,\\operatorname{Pref}(\\bar Q,\\bar z,\\phi),\\qquad(Q\\bar z)\\phi\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Pref}(\\langle Q\\rangle_{i=1}^{|\\bar z|},\\bar z,\\phi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Pref}(\\langle\\rangle,\\langle\\rangle,\\phi)\\coloneqq\\phi,\\qquad\\operatorname{Pref}(\\langle Q\\rangle\\Vert\\bar Q,\\langle z\\rangle\\Vert\\bar z,\\phi)\\coloneqq Qz\\,\\operatorname{Pref}(\\bar Q,\\bar z,\\phi),\\qquad(Q\\bar z)\\phi\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Pref}(\\langle Q\\rangle_{i=1}^{|\\bar z|},\\bar z,\\phi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-ac